From a433d077291a7cc1734fede861b239ec33dc7bc1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:22:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Priorities: move onto the page structure (PrioritiesPage
 + PrioritiesPageContext)

- PriorityMatrixPage becomes PrioritiesPage and absorbs PrioritiesScreen
  (the BoardHeader column); PrioritiesScreen is gone.
- The route is an adapter: toPrioritiesPageProps(matrix, today) in
  oneOffUtils picks the active plan id and the header's week (the plan's,
  else today's ISO week); matrixService is unchanged.
- groupTasksByQuadrant and isTrackedTask in oneOffUtils replace the
  container's useMemo grouping and the two inline isTracked checks;
  FALLBACK_QUADRANT moves there with them. Unit tests for all three.
- New PrioritiesPageContext carries activePlanId, the open popover, the
  overlay openers and the Track / Done writes. Props shrink: QuadrantCell
  9 -> 2, MatrixTaskCard 9 -> 2, MoveToPopover 4 -> 1, MoveToRows 5 -> 2,
  MobileMoveToSheet 6 -> 2, MobileMoveToPanel 5 -> 1.
- Design Console: the matrix tabs render PrioritiesPage from raw fixtures
  through the same adapter; the mobile sheet scenario and the gallery's
  MatrixTaskCard specimen render in inertPrioritiesPageContext, with
  "tracked" expressed as the task's planId matching the plan.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KCt6pMa91jhjUM2oez842a
